  ```
  The `.ws-root` path already goes on its own line (line 102). `.ws-header` has `flex-wrap: nowrap` at line 4 and `wrap` below 900 px (line 101): keep that.
- **GOTCHA (iOS zoom)**: `.ws-filter input` (line 18) and `.clone-search input` (line 71) set `font: 13px …` with a higher specificity than a plain `input` rule. Look at the dependency's `@media (pointer: coarse)` input rule in base.css; unless it already wins (e.g. `!important`), add `@media (pointer: coarse) { .ws-filter input, .clone-search input { font-size: 16px; } }`.
