### UPDATE `apps/graph-manager/src/web/ui/components.test.tsx`

- **IMPLEMENT** (regression guard for the structure the drawer/dialog CSS relies on), next to the existing Drawer test (line 87) and ConfirmDialog tests (lines 57–85):
  - Drawer with a footer: the `aside.drawer` children are, in order, `.drawer-header`, `.drawer-body`, `.drawer-footer`; the Close button (`aria-label="Close"`) is inside `.drawer-header`, not in the scrolling body. Without a `footer` prop there is no `.drawer-footer` and `.drawer-body` is the last child.
  - ConfirmDialog: `.dialog` children are, in order, `h2.dialog-title`, `.dialog-body`, `.dialog-actions`, and the confirm button is inside `.dialog-actions`.
